    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Au coeur de la Dr\u00f4me proven\u00e7ale, Louise \u00e9l\u00e8ve seule ses deux enfants et tente de pr\u00e9server l\u2019exploitation familiale. Un soir, elle manque d\u2019\u00e9craser un inconnu au comportement singulier. Cet homme se r\u00e9v\u00e8le vite diff\u00e9rent de la plupart des gens. Et sa capacit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9merveillement pourrait bien changer la vie de Louise et de sa famille.",
        "english": "In the heart of the Dr\u00f4me in Provence, Louise raises her two children alone while trying to maintain and run the family farm. One evening, she narrowly misses running over a stranger. The man quickly reveals himself to be very different from most other people. And his ability to be amazed may indeed change life for Louise and her family."
